            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration, up to 1 hour"
            ^"Concentration" BOOLEAN true
            ^"Description" STRING "You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is Heavily Obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by *Gust of Wind*) disperses it."
            ^"At Higher Levels" STRING "The fog's radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1."
            ^"Classes" LIST OF STRING ["Druid", "Ranger", "Sorcerer", "Wizard"]
