            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration, up to 10 minutes"
            ^"Concentration" BOOLEAN true
            ^"Description" STRING "For the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or object entirely inside the Sphere has Immunity to Thunder damage, and creatures have the Deafened condition while entirely inside it. Casting a spell that includes a Verbal component is impossible there."
            ^"Classes" LIST OF STRING ["Bard", "Cleric", "Ranger"]
