                ^"Description"
                STRING "The mouther babbles incoherently while it doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition. *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 10, any creature that starts its turn within 20 feet of the mouther while it is babbling. *Failure:* The target rolls 1d8 to determine what it does during the current turn: **1–4.** The target does nothing. **5–6.** The target takes no action or Bonus Action and uses all its movement to move in a random direction. **7–8.** The target makes a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach or does nothing if it can’t make such an attack."
